zutoml has no vendored code of its own. It compiles the header-only zufast
library (LinkingTo: zufast, https://github.com/pedrobtz/zufast) into its
shared object, and the parts of zufast it uses carry the third-party code
below. zufast's inst/COPYRIGHTS and inst/licenses/ record the pinned
versions and patches.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
